                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f572510d-96db-3250-844a-26006ee5a982",
                        "entry_id": "d1d02e8b-0575-3f14-9f73-78cf08c917b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fläche, die nur eine Kante und eine Seite hat"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d6d1ddf-d5e0-4ea2-930f-9ff945a9d5da",
                                "sense_id": "f572510d-96db-3250-844a-26006ee5a982",
                                "text": "„Der Ortswechsel wurde ihm erst bewusst, als der Bildschirmschoner einsetzte und die Löcher in der Luft sich in hypnotisierende Spiralen aus bunten Möbiusbändern verwandelten - ein zu irrwitziger Anblick, um ihn zu ignorieren oder als Halluzination abzutun.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04b7f350-d7fd-4acb-8544-eb28c080b853",
                                "sense_id": "f572510d-96db-3250-844a-26006ee5a982",
                                "text": "„Darauf war etwas zu sehen, das einem Möbiusband ähnelte.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a2af85c4-fdf4-4986-9e7f-d85a6adbcd35",
                        "source_entry_id": "d1d02e8b-0575-3f14-9f73-78cf08c917b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "f572510d-96db-3250-844a-26006ee5a982",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fläche mit nur einer Kante und Seite",
                        "target_lang_word": "莫比烏斯帶",
                        "target_lang_code": "zh",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "24b5ca95-29b7-49b2-8980-6f16c3a03ba4",
                        "source_entry_id": "d1d02e8b-0575-3f14-9f73-78cf08c917b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "f572510d-96db-3250-844a-26006ee5a982",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fläche mit nur einer Kante und Seite",
                        "target_lang_word": "Möbius strip",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Möbius strip",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6d2b9eb-970e-3ca1-a12d-2dc45076688c",
                                        "entry_id": "6dd0a70b-05cc-3b7f-ae46-057e0d1c6f4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A one-sided surface formed by identifying two opposite edges of a square in opposite senses;"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b67be61-b100-4ba5-8cc4-cbc945fee509",
                                                "sense_id": "c6d2b9eb-970e-3ca1-a12d-2dc45076688c",
                                                "text": "Like a mind moving on a Möbius strip of events, one's consciousness goes over the same territory again and again without ever becoming aware of the nature of awareness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a4ba441-d84e-4bd2-a23a-ed103b031804",
                                                "sense_id": "c6d2b9eb-970e-3ca1-a12d-2dc45076688c",
                                                "text": "1991, Theoni Pappas, More Joy of Mathematics, Wide World Publishing, page 117,\nB. F. Goodrich Co. has a patent for a Möbius strip conveyor belt. It lasts longer since the wear and tear is spread uniformly over the entire surface."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9ce8c86-3d11-4ebe-8826-d913aaf35835",
                                                "sense_id": "c6d2b9eb-970e-3ca1-a12d-2dc45076688c",
                                                "text": "A geometrical model of electron (positron) structure is presented based upon an object of two linked loops obtained by cutting a Möbius strip asymmetrically."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ab5d90d-ccdd-43be-996e-f3af1ee0e1c2",
                                                "sense_id": "c6d2b9eb-970e-3ca1-a12d-2dc45076688c",
                                                "text": "Proust's novel grew and deepened into over 3,000 pages of everything and nothing: a Möbius strip of profundity twisting into mundanity, mundanity twisting into profundity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e33e09f3-43a9-3c6f-a3c2-1c038c0dd71d",
                                        "entry_id": "6dd0a70b-05cc-3b7f-ae46-057e0d1c6f4e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A one-sided surface formed by identifying two opposite edges of a square in opposite senses;\\na narrow strip given a half twist and joined at the ends, forming a three-dimensional embedding of said surface.",
                                            "a narrow strip given a half twist and joined at the ends, forming a three-dimensional embedding of said surface."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "166083e9-013c-443f-af3e-030d9770b35a",
                        "source_entry_id": "d1d02e8b-0575-3f14-9f73-78cf08c917b5",
                        "source_sense_id": "f572510d-96db-3250-844a-26006ee5a982",
                        "source_sense_description": "Fläche mit nur einer Kante und Seite",
                        "target_lang_word": "ruban de Möbius",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ruban de Möbius",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b34b9b82-7328-30a3-9c01-8678cea85241",
                                        "entry_id": "12591794-108f-311a-83be-875a97d5a96b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Surface réglée compacte dont le bord est homéomorphe à un cercle (ruban ne possédant qu’une seule surface et un seul bord)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92be5209-fe4c-4c64-90fb-b3a379adaf66",
                                                "sense_id": "b34b9b82-7328-30a3-9c01-8678cea85241",
                                                "text": "À l’heure où s’achève ma traversée de la rue Férou, cette fresque où se nouent portraits et autoportraits, je vois qu’elle s’étire telle un ruban de Möbius, brouillant l’avers et l’envers, les unissant en une roue sans fin ni commencement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
